  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Edmund Rice Development PROJECT: This project aims to empower vulnerable girls by facilitating their access to education providing essential school learning materials, reusable sanitary pads and basic medical support for the treatment of common illnesses like malaria and typhoid. Impacts of climate change are also addressed, facilitating the adaptation of livelihood strategies, fostering the creation of new employment opportunities, the generation of additional household income and increase food security. Activities include training on climate-smart agriculture, climate adaptation and mitigation, soil fertility.</narrative>
  </description>
